01:15:47,368 --> 01:15:53,368
King Richard is a 2021 American biographical sports drama film directed
by Reinaldo Marcus Green and written by Zach Baylin.

11
01:23:22,105 --> 01:23:28,105
The film stars Will Smith as Richard Williams, the father and coach of famed tennis players Venus and Serena Williams (both of whom served as
executive producers on the film), with Aunjanue Ellis, Saniyya Sidney, Demi Singleton, Tony Goldwyn, and Jon Bernthal in supporting roles.

12
01:30:56,842 --> 01:31:02,842
It premiered at the 48th Telluride Film Festival on September 2, 2021, and was
theatrically released on November 19, 2021, by Warner Bros.

13
01:38:31,578 --> 01:38:37,578
Pictures and on the HBO Max streaming service.

14
01:46:06,315 --> 01:46:12,315
Although it was a box office failure, grossing $39 million against a budget of $50 million, the film received positive
reviews from critics, with praise for the screenplay and the performances of Smith, Ellis, and Sidney.

15
01:53:41,052 --> 01:53:47,052
It was named one of the ten best films of the year by both the
American Film Institute and the National Board of Review.

16
02:01:15,789 --> 02:01:21,789
It earned six nominations at the 94th Academy Awards, including
Best Picture, and won Best Actor for Will Smith.

17
